  unitName: Swiftwind Raquiel
  unitId: 850437
  unitNumber: 8420
  description: Crafted from the many winds of her progenitor-Titan, Raquiel was one
    of many air spirits that served as messengers to humanity from the heavens. As
    one of the swiftest and craftiest heralds, she made it a point to excel in every
    task that she was given, no matter how complex. Her memory of the many stories
    of the world was endless, and in her spare time she would seek to add to her
    well of knowledge whatever she could find. But the greatest joy for Raquiel were
    the songs of creation itself, and soon she was well-known as a tutelary spirit
    of knowledge. Sorcerers would eagerly summon her, a task she relished at first--she
    grew to hate it, though, as their petty demands increased while the war between
    the Titans and the Raug raged on. Didn't they have better things to do? Still,
    she could not swerve from her task, even as her contempt began to show. As the
    ranks of her fellow herald-spirits began to dwindle due to the Raug, Raquiel
    found herself serving as a swift-footed guide and messenger to their increasingly
    dwindling allies. Her skills, however, could not keep her safe forever. A demonic
    ambush waylaid her, and it was only by the command of a powerful magician that
    she escaped their clutches. It was then that despair began to suffocate her heart...
  summonDesc: Hail, Summoner. Be not afraid! Rejoice! For the gods have favored thee.
  fusionDesc: It is good that your kindness exists in this cruel world. It is a sign
    that the gods may yet win...
